>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TEST-JSON.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY "appointment-status.cpy".
COPY "appointment-service-request.cpy".
COPY "appointment-service-result.cpy".
01 TEST-OP PIC X(16).
01 REQUEST-PATH PIC X(256).
01 RESPONSE-PATH PIC X(256) VALUE "build/test-json-response.json".
01 FAILURES PIC 9 VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE "READ" TO TEST-OP
    MOVE "tests/fixtures/json-escaped.json" TO REQUEST-PATH
    CALL "APPOINTMENT-JSON" USING TEST-OP REQUEST-PATH RESPONSE-PATH
      APPOINTMENT-SERVICE-REQUEST APPOINTMENT-SERVICE-RESULT
    IF ASO-STATUS-CODE NOT = APPT-OK ADD 1 TO FAILURES END-IF
    IF FUNCTION TRIM(ASR-CLIENT) NOT = 'A "quoted" client' ADD 1 TO FAILURES END-IF
    IF FUNCTION TRIM(ASR-SUBJECT) NOT = "Backslash \ test" ADD 1 TO FAILURES END-IF
    MOVE "tests/fixtures/json-invalid.json" TO REQUEST-PATH
    CALL "APPOINTMENT-JSON" USING TEST-OP REQUEST-PATH RESPONSE-PATH
      APPOINTMENT-SERVICE-REQUEST APPOINTMENT-SERVICE-RESULT
    IF ASO-STATUS-CODE = APPT-OK ADD 1 TO FAILURES END-IF
    DISPLAY "json tests failures=" FAILURES
    MOVE FAILURES TO RETURN-CODE GOBACK.
END PROGRAM TEST-JSON.
